msgstr "**Resumo do Cluster:** ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Summary`` mostra a utilização agregada de memória, CPU e armazenamento"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:188
msgid ""
"**Host Detail:** Individual host pages show per-host memory and CPU "
